Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The molten wallpaper's GLSL (web/src/lib/moltenShader.ts, ported to C in
linux/src/draw/lp_molten.c) is derived from a shader by Mårten Rånge, published
on Shadertoy. Its licence has not been established: Shadertoy's default terms
are CC BY-NC-SA 3.0, which is not compatible with the Apache License 2.0. This
needs to be resolved before the shader is distributed under this LICENSE — by
confirming the author's terms, obtaining permission, or replacing the field.
See docs/design-direction.md.

The web package depends on React and Vite, and the C library links Cairo, Pango,
fontconfig, pixman and libxkbcommon, optionally wlroots, Wayland, EGL and
OpenGL ES. None of them are included here; each carries its own licence.
